Attribution
-----------

Wave Link Backup is a fork of voltybat/WaveLinkSettingsUtility, which is also
MIT licensed:

    https://github.com/voltybat/WaveLinkSettingsUtility

The first copyright line above is upstream's, reproduced verbatim from their
LICENSE as required by the MIT terms. It covers the code inherited from that
project — package discovery, Core Audio endpoint enumeration, the Wave Link
shutdown sequence, atomic file replacement, and the seam interfaces those rest
on. The second line covers everything added here.

Both notices apply to the distributed work as a whole. Removing either one
would breach the licence.

What was taken from upstream, what needed changing, and why forking rather
than contributing back was the right call is written up in:

    _docs/audits/2026-08-15-voltybat-wavelinksettingsutility.md
    _docs/decisions/ADR-002-fork-wavelinksettingsutility.md
